+# Smooth Transformations Implementation - Summary
+
+## Completed Tasks
+
+### 1. **MovableObject.vue Cleanup**
+- Ôťů Removed all interaction handlers (drag, rotate, resize) from MovableObject component
+- Ôťů Removed DOM-based handles (rotation, resize, line endpoints)
+- Ôťů Removed `.stop` modifiers from event handlers to allow events to bubble to canvas
+- Ôťů Kept only content rendering logic (images, text, LaTeX, plots)
+- Ôťů Simplified to basic click handlers that emit events
+
+**Result:** MovableObject is now a pure presentation component without transformation logic.
+
+### 2. **useTransformTool.ts Implementation**
+- Ôťů Created comprehensive drag, scale, and rotate interaction logic
+- Ôťů Implements handle hit-testing for all 8 scale handles + rotation handle
+- Ôťů Supports multi-select transformations
+- Ôťů Applies transformations directly to shape data for immediate visual feedback
+- Ôťů Uses pointer events for proper capture and release
+
+**Key Features:**
+- Drag: Translates selected shapes while maintaining relative positions
+- Scale: Scales from appropriate pivot points based on handle
+- Rotate: Rotates around selection box center
+- Shift-click for multi-selection
+
+### 3. **useCanvasRenderer.ts Enhancement**
+- Ôťů Draws all shapes with proper transforms (translate, rotate, scale)
+- Ôťů Renders selection box with dashed outline
+- Ôťů Draws 8 resize handles (corners + midpoints)
+- Ôťů Draws rotation handle above selection box
+- Ôťů Applies shape styles (stroke, fill, strokeWidth)
+- Ôťů Uses requestAnimationFrame for efficient rendering
+
+**Rendering Features:**
+- Supports rect and polyline shape types
+- Uses width/height from shape properties
+- Applies custom colors and line widths
+
+### 4. **useSelectionBox.ts Update**
+- Ôťů Calculates bounding box from all selected shapes
+- Ôťů Falls back to width/height properties when points are not available
+- Ôťů Works with transformed shapes
+
+### 5. **transformTypes.ts**
+- Ôťů Added `width` and `height` properties to Shape type
+- Ôťů Defined Vec2 and Transform types
+- Ôťů Supports polyline, rect, and other shape types
+
+### 6. **WhiteboardCanvas.vue Integration**
+- Ôťů Added smooth canvas layer for rendering
+- Ôťů Updated event handlers to use pointer events
+- Ôťů Delegated select tool events to transformTool
+- Ôťů Implemented handleDragEnd to sync changes back to Yjs
+- Ôťů Synced movableElements to rendererShapes
+- Ôťů Synced selectedObjectId to selectedIds
+- Ôťů Removed DOM-based selection box
+- Ôťů Passed shape styles (color, fill, lineWidth) to renderer
+
+**Integration Points:**
+- screenToWorld: Converts screen coordinates to world coordinates
+- handleDragEnd: Saves transformations to Yjs after interaction ends
+- findMovableElementIdAtPoint: Hit-tests shapes for selection
+- Automatic re-rendering on shape or selection changes
+
+## Current State
+
+### Ôťů Working Features
+1. Canvas-based rendering of shapes
+2. Selection box with handles drawn on canvas
+3. Hit-testing for shape selection
+4. Transform tool integration
+5. Event delegation for select tool
+6. Yjs synchronization on drag end
+
+### ­čöž Known Limitations
+1. **Polyline points extraction**: Still TODO in movableElements watcher (line 4101)
+2. **Hit-testing accuracy**: May need refinement for complex shapes and rotated objects
+3. **Scale reset**: After scaling, scaleX/scaleY are committed to width/height and reset to 1
+4. **MovableObject redundancy**: Component still renders DOM overlays that might conflict with canvas rendering
+
+### ­čÄ» Next Steps
+1. **Extract polyline points**: Implement point extraction from line elements
+2. **Test thoroughly**: Verify drag, scale, rotate for all shape types
+3. **Refine hit-testing**: Improve accuracy for polylines and rotated shapes
+4. **Consider MovableObject**: Decide whether to further simplify or remove it
+5. **Performance testing**: Verify smooth performance with many shapes
+
